About packages

[network and general system utilities]
tree → visualize directory structure.
ca-certificates → root certificates for HTTPS verification.
curl → command-line HTTP client.
gnupg → GPG encryption/signing tools.
net-tools → ifconfig, netstat, etc.
dnsutils → DNS query tools like dig, nslookup.
netcat-traditional → network debugging, TCP/UDP client/server.


[security auditing and monitoring]
lynis → security auditing and compliance tool.
acct → process accounting (logs commands executed by users).
sysstat → system performance monitoring (iostat, mpstat).
auditd → audit daemon for system-level logging.
chkrootkit → rootkit detection.
fail2ban → bans IPs for repeated failed login attempts.
libpam-pwquality → PAM module to enforce strong passwords.


[system integrity, package verification, crypto]
libcrack2 → library for password checking/cracking tools.
apt-show-versions → show which package versions are installed/available.
debsums → verify integrity of installed packages.
libpam-tmpdir → secure temporary directories for users.
apt-listbugs → show critical bugs before installing/upgrading packages.
openssl → encryption, certificates, TLS tools.
